            <!-- Secondary (30332), fixed 400px - fits "Start from
                 beginning" (the longest realistic label) with room to
                 spare. Unfocused: hollow border built from four
                 white.png edges, same technique as the panel border
                 above. Focused: palette's general focus fill
                 (FF1B2126, not the accent) so it reads as focused
                 without ever looking like the recommended action. -->
            <control type="image"><left>628</left><top>560</top><width>400</width><height>1</height><texture colordiffuse="38FFFFFF">white.png</texture><visible>!Control.HasFocus(30332)</visible></control>
            <control type="image"><left>628</left><top>623</top><width>400</width><height>1</height><texture colordiffuse="38FFFFFF">white.png</texture><visible>!Control.HasFocus(30332)</visible></control>
