            <!-- Primary (30333), fixed 248px - right-flush against the
                 same 1292 edge the heading/body use, so 400 + 16 gap +
                 248 lands exactly on their 664-wide column. Unfocused:
                 hollow accent border so it still reads as the
                 recommended action before it has focus. Focused: solid
                 accent fill + dark bold text per spec; takes focus on
                 open via the window's <defaultcontrol>. -->
            <control type="image"><left>1044</left><top>560</top><width>248</width><height>1</height><texture colordiffuse="8038BDF8">white.png</texture><visible>!Control.HasFocus(30333)</visible></control>
